frontend,src/tagcast/static/help.js,236,Help tours,ui,string,prop,steps,3,0,0,Find a group
frontend,src/tagcast/static/help.js,236,Help tours,ui,string,prop,steps,23,0,0,"Choose a decade card to discover its albums. Years come from the tracks, with the album year as fallback. Unknown years are excluded."
frontend,src/tagcast/static/help.js,236,Help tours,ui,string,prop,steps,25,0,0,"Search or sort the groups, then choose a card to see its matching albums. Album totals follow the same merged sets as the album browser."
frontend,src/tagcast/static/help.js,237,Help tours,ui,string,prop,steps,3,0,0,Open matching albums
frontend,src/tagcast/static/help.js,237,Help tours,ui,string,prop,steps,17,0,0,Each card opens the albums belonging to that group. Back returns to your previous search and page.
