frontend,src/tagcast/static/lookup.js,175,"Metadata editor helpers: credits, genres, online lookup, artwork",ui,html-text,ui-prop,innerHTML,32,0,0,"Off by default. Uses iBroadcast’s queue server. After enabling, reconnect iBroadcast once to approve queue read/write permissions, then open Devices. Only the player records plays; remote controllers do not play audio."
